{"id":86247,"slug":"red-oaks-2015","title":"Red Oaks","title_en":"Red Oaks","year":2015,"rating":76,"votes_count":59,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"V létě roku roku 1985 nastoupí dvacetiletý David Meyers (Craig Roberts) na místo tenisového trenéra do sportovního klubu Red Oaks na předměstí New Jersey. V klubu se David Meyers seznámí se skupinkou různorodých vyvrhelů, kteří jsou jeho spolupracovníky, a také se zámožnými členy klubu.(SoldierDomas)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/161/624/161624676_94569f.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie"],"tags":["přátelství","dospívání","prázdniny"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["David Gordon Green","Hal Hartley","Andrew Fleming","Nisha Ganatra","Amy Heckerling","Gregg Araki"],"actors":["Craig Roberts","Jennifer Grey","Ennis Esmer","Gage Golightly","Oliver Cooper","Josh Meyers","Richard Kind","Paul Reiser","Frank Deal","Jessica Hecht","Alexandra Socha","Gina Gershon","Alexandra Turshen","Yuval Boim","Lev Pakman","Nate Smith","David Fierro","Jim Florentine","Murielle Telio","James Waterston","Marc Damon Johnson","John Reynolds","Kate MacCluggage","Tom Papa","Kelly Aaron","Jacob Morrell","Cliff Moylan","Wally Dunn","Lana Yoo","Tate Donovan","Patricia Buckley","Rick Crom","Richard Masur","Nat Cassidy","Doris McCarthy","Maria Aparo","Brad Gilbert","David Serero","Mark Linn-Baker","Annabelle Dexter-Jones","John Hodgman","Suzanne Savoy","Allison Lanier","Alan Aisenberg","Beth Stelling","Rachel Feinstein","Faith Logan","Samuel H. Levine","Kathy Searle","Juliet Brett","Brittini Schreiber","Jacob Berger","Tijuana Ricks","Michael Cumpsty","Roe Hartrampf","Shane Nepveu","James Cusati-Moyer","Mackenzie Lansing","Andy Bustillos","Amelia Workman","Adriana Ducassi","Dave T. Koenig","Neal Lerner","Mick Szal","Reggie Alvin Green","Annie Henk","Greer Barnes","Ryan Farrell","Grayson Eddey","Joe Lanza"],"screenwriter